<title>UK: Cater Allen in talks on possible takeover.</title>
<headline>Cater Allen in talks on possible takeover.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British financial services group and discount house Cater Allen Holdings Plc said on Thursday it was in talks which could possibly lead to a recommended offer.</p>
<p>The company said an announcement would be made &quot;in due course&quot; but gave no further details.</p>
<p>In March, Cater Allen bought Union Plc's equity market-making subsidiary Aitken Campbell &amp; Co Ltd.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
